<section class="framework-section luxury-approach-section" id="buyers-checklist">   <div class="container">     <div class="section-header premium-reveal" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">                  <h2 class="section-title"><span style="color: #141D24;">The right home </span><span style="color: #7d442a;">starts with you.</span></h2>         <p class="luxury-approach-desc">Independent advisory anchored in your priorities, not developer inventory.</p>         </div><div class="luxury-approach-grid">       <!-- Left Column -->       <div class="luxury-approach-left premium-reveal"><div class="luxury-approach-img-wrapper">           <img src="style-guide/assets/approach-balcony.webp?v=20260827_balcony_v3" alt="Home buyer evaluating luxury Bengaluru residential apartment balcony view with Acre&amp;Key advisory" class="cinematic-drift" width="1024" height="682" loading="lazy" decoding="async">         </div>       </div>        <!-- Right Column -->       <div class="luxury-approach-right premium-reveal" data-nosnippet data-stagger-children=".stagger-reveal">         <div class="luxury-approach-list">
          <div class="luxury-approach-item stagger-reveal">
            <div class="luxury-approach-num">01.</div>
            <div class="luxury-approach-content">
              <h3 class="luxury-approach-heading">Does it fit your life?</h3>
              <p class="luxury-approach-text">We map the home to your lifestyle, budget, commute and timeline. More space near Budigere means little if the location compromises how you actually spend your day.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="luxury-approach-item stagger-reveal">
            <div class="luxury-approach-num">02.</div>
            <div class="luxury-approach-content">
              <h3 class="luxury-approach-heading">What could you be missing?</h3>
              <p class="luxury-approach-text">We look beyond the brochure, assessing approvals, access, water, drainage, future towers, lift ratios and usable open space. The overlooked details often shape long-term livability.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="luxury-approach-item stagger-reveal">
            <div class="luxury-approach-num">03.</div>
            <div class="luxury-approach-content">
              <h3 class="luxury-approach-heading">Is the premium justified?</h3>
              <p class="luxury-approach-text">We assess the all-inclusive cost, carpet efficiency, payment plan and alternatives. A Whitefield premium may be justified by connectivity and liquidity, while another corridor may already price in future growth.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="luxury-approach-item stagger-reveal">
            <div class="luxury-approach-num">04.</div>
            <div class="luxury-approach-content">
              <h3 class="luxury-approach-heading">Can the developer deliver on the promise?</h3>
              <p class="luxury-approach-text">We assess financial strength, RERA history, construction progress and delivery on comparable projects. A respected brand offers confidence, but the specific project still deserves independent scrutiny.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="luxury-approach-item stagger-reveal">
            <div class="luxury-approach-num">05.</div>
            <div class="luxury-approach-content">
              <h3 class="luxury-approach-heading">Where will your returns actually come from?</h3>
              <p class="luxury-approach-text">We compare demand, competing supply and infrastructure across Bengaluru's key corridors. Then we test entry price and future liquidity, rather than relying on a developer's appreciation story.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>       </div>     </div>             </div> </section>